<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 5,045 packages of landed tea sold at this week's London sale was 125.82 pence a kilo against 118.47 last week and 101.98 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 116,347 pkgs sold so far this year is 128.02 pence against 111.77 pence for the 161,286 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
